<title>UK: Dept de la Meuse sets 150 mln FRF domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Dept de la Meuse sets 150 mln FRF domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Departement de la Meuse has launched a 150 million French franc 12-year domestic bond, Caisse des Depots et Consignations said Friday as lead manager.</p>
<p>The deal will be guaranteed by U.S. insurer MBIA.</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN FRF   COUPON     5.90	MATURITY    04.APR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.588   PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.30	REOFFER    99.638    SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  1.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.50 PCT 2008 OAT / 6.50 PCT 2011 OAT</p>
<p> -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
